          "audioText": "Hello! My name is Rose. My husband is Dan. That boy is our son, Leo. We have one child.",
          "question": {
            "en": "How many children do Rose and Dan have?",
            "th": "โรสกับแดนมีลูกกี่คน"
          },
          "choices": [
            "One",
